WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.836
♪♪

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:05.255
You may think that luck is just
random,

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:07.591
but in our new film, you'll
discover that

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:13.138
Jane Fonda:
there's an entire world
dedicated to creating the luck we experience every day.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:16.391
Wait, they actually think up the
good luck?

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:16.767
Yeah.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:18.894
The land of luck isn't all
sunshine and rainbows.

00:00:18.894 --> 00:00:19.811
Ow!

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:23.440
I mean, sure. There is lots of
sunshine and the occasional
rainbow.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:24.691
It's really nice, actually.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.109
♪♪ 

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:28.320
But, that's only because there's
rules.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.446
Good luck to us both.

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:31.823
♪♪

00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:35.327
For instance, good luck
creatures can only travel to and
from the human world

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:36.411
Eva Noblezada:
using a lucky penny.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:38.830
Elf Manager:
Let's get these pennies in tip
top shape.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:43.001
Which by the way, you must
always return upon arrival.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:48.715
Elf Manager:
Everyone knows the punishment
for stealing good luck is banishment to bad luck.

00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:54.304
Another important rule: when it
comes to bad luck, avoid it at
all costs.

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:56.098
If you don't she'll know.

00:00:56.807 --> 00:00:58.267
(Sniffs and exclaims)

00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.393
Rabbits!

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:00.727
She always does.

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.479
Ahh, much better.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.148
And above all else, no humans
allowed.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.316
Ahh!

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.109
Sam &amp; Bob:
(Scream)

00:01:07.109 --> 00:01:10.070
If a human ever stepped foot in
the Land of Luck...

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.238
It'd be bad.

00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:12.114
♪♪

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:12.656
(Exclaims)

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.865
♪♪

00:01:13.865 --> 00:01:15.158
Oh this can't be happening.

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.034
♪♪

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:17.536
Ahh!

00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:19.079
(Sigh) Yikes.

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:25.961
Learn more about the Land of
Luck when the new Apple Original
Film, "Luck" hits Apple TV+,

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:26.962
August 5th.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.881
This is the moment we've all
been waiting for.

